{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "The gang is out there smuggling guns, and I need some help pinning down the route.": "",
  "But don't forget, they're a gang, and they're dangerous. If you feel threatened, you've gotta get out.": "",
  "Yagami... I'm still pretty sore about that time you stole my clothes.": "",
  "Ha. I just want you to play it safe.": "",
  "But these Keihin fools piss me off a lot more than that. So I'm in.": "",
  "I'm gonna teach 'em who runs this town!": "",
  "Hoho, I'm just glad you finally realized you need my powers, Master Yagami.": "",
  "I will show you the most ultimate ninja technique known to me!": "",
  "You guessed it... The power of <font_kind=yakuza_italic>friendship</font_kind>!": "",
  "O-Oh. Yeah, I kinda did that. I'm sorry, man.": "",
  "Yo. Drinking you under the table isn't the only thing I'm good at, you know. I could kick your ass, too, little bro.": "",
  "I'm Ryo Suzaki, and I'm so uneducated and unemployed, the yakuza themselves fear me!": "",
  "I'm looking forward to seeing that in action, Ryan.": "",
  "I've got your back!": "",
  "Right. Glad to have you.": "",
  "All right, let's see what we can find. Split up, and let me know if you figure anything out.": "",
  "I'll call you if anything turns up.": "",
  "Hey, did you hear about the shooting that happened here?": "",
  "Yeah, I did! Some college kid with a gun, right?": "",
  "Don't tell anyone, but my friend got a gun too.": "",
  "Huh!? You joking!?": "",
  "(This sounds promising...)": "",
  "No, seriously. He even told me how to buy one if I wanted it.": "",
  "First, you go to a deserted area and you post to Chatter with the hashtag, \"bangbangbusiness.\"": "",
  "Then the gun guy shows up at your location!": "",
  "Wha!? That's hella scary! How would they even know!?": "",
  "Because you post with your location turned on, dummy.": "",
  "Wait, you can do that?": "",
  "Dude, it's right there in the settings. Just turn it on.": "",
  "Whoa, I probably kept it off for a reason! That's some super spy level shit.": "",
  "Well if you do it, apparently a guy in a red scarf shows up at your location.": "",
  "They say he doesn't even look like a seller...": "",
  "But if you go up to him and say, \"bang bang business,\" he'll sell you a gun.": "",
  "(No wonder they've been so hard to track. They're coming directly to the buyers...)": "",
  "(Crap! That's...)": "",
  "Hm? What's that smell...?": "",
  "*sniff* *sniff*": "",
  "Sakakiba-san, what's up?": "",
  "I smell prey. I smell... Yagami.": "",
  "(He can <font_kind=yakuza_italic>smell</font_kind> me!?)": "",
  "Fooooound you!": "",
  "I'm gonna celebrate beating you with a big ass meal!": "",
  "Shit! Guess I've got no choice now!": "",
  "Yagami-san! Let me help you out!": "",
  "Thanks a bunch, Tanago.": "",
  "Hey, doughnut dumpster! You wanna punch this guy? See if you can get through me!": "",
  "You couldn't hit me in a week! I'll let you give it your best shot, though!": "",
  "Hey, did you hear about that shooting that happened here?": "",
  "Of course. It was one of those Oki U. students that did it, right?": "",
  "I hear the cops caught him and he's getting kicked outta school. What an idiot.": "",
  "Right? Why would you even want a gun in the first place?": "",
  "(Hm, doesn't look like it's going anywhere after all.)": "",
  "Man, I'm still kinda scared to hang around here.": "",
  "For real. After what happened? I'm still pretty damn shook.": "",
  "(Wait a sec...)": "",
  "Fuckin' Izumi, right? The bathroom was right there...": "",
  "I know, I can't believe he barfed right on the sidewalk! What if someone thinks it was us!?": "",
  "(Gah. Guess I walked into that one.)": "",
  "Hey, what'd that Yagami guy do to get a 10 million yen price on his head?": "",
  "I heard he's the worst. Burglary, arson, murder, molestation, public exposure...": "",
  "That monster's committed every crime in the book.": "",
  "(How do rumors like that even start? I better get outta here before I get caught.)": "",
  "*pant* *pant* That all you got!? You gonna start trying to hit me soon!?": "",
  "What's your problem!? This some kinda fetish for you!?": "",
  "Sakakiba... The show's over. Tell me where the guns are coming from.": "",
  "(A few people turned up... Is one of them the seller?)": "",
  "(Now, how to approach him.)": "",
  "(Wait, someone else made the same post in the same spot? Guess I better watch how this unfolds.)": "",
  "What's the password?": "",
  "The red scarf... I'm the guy who posted on Chatter.": "",
  "Password? Oh, right... It's...": "",
  "Let's see some ID.": "",
  "Pretty prestigious school, isn't it? Why you in the market for a piece?": "",
  "Bang bang... business...": "",
  "80k for Chinese, 150k for Russian. Cash up front or there's gonna be interest.": "",
  "...Sure!": "",
  "Hm? Me? Oh no, I'm good.": "",
  "(Damn, did that raise his suspicion?)": "",
  "(Wait, is he stopping to eat? Dressed like that?)": "",
  "I knew I saw someone sneaking around... You're Yagami, right!?": "",
  "Your height and gait are a dead giveaway!": "",
  "Tch, you never give up, huh?": "",
  "That ten mil is ours! Prepare to die, Yagami!": "",
  "With me around, you oughta consider taking your own advice.": "",
  "Great timing, Ryo. I could use the help.": "",
  "I got you. But you owe me a drink when this is over!": "",
  "Heh. Besides... gives me a good story to talk about with my little bro.": "",
  "Thanks a ton, Ryo.": "",
  "Hey man, happy to bail out a friend!": "",
  "(I lost some time, but that homeless guy didn't leave, right?)": "",
  "(Gotta keep an eye out, I guess.)": "",
  "(Whoa, did he change while was in there?)": "",
  "(...He must've. I'll just have to wait till he leaves to follow him.)": "",
  "Wait, where'd he go? The bathroom, maybe?": "",
  "Nope... He vanished.": "",
  "Hey! What do you think you're doing!?": "",
  "Hey, you guys seen a homeless guy in a red scarf around?": "",
  "You're interrupting me, man! Get lost!": "",
  "You're sure? I'm certain he came this way.": "",
  "You're pretty suspicious, my man. Show your face!": "",
  "Wait, I know who you are! What are you doing here!?": "",
  "Huh? What are you guys...": "",
  "Y-You sonuvabitch! How'd you figure out that we're on top of that!?": "",
  "(Crap, he's part of the Keihin Gang, isn't he!?)": "",
  "Who told you!? I'll kill the snitches!": "",
  "(Does that mean he's... working here? Did I find their base?)": "",
  "Huh!? What's that supposed to mean!?": "",
  "Your gun smuggling operation is just ahead, isn't it?": "",
  "What was that!? You calling me a pair of scissors!?": "",
  "Ah, so it's below us?": "",
  "Don't you dare get all cocky with me! I'll show you...": "",
  "I'll show you how terrifying it is... when a fool uses scissors!": "",
  "Hold up! I think I can handle this one.": "",
  "You just did, actually.": "",
  "Wh-Who the hell are you!? And what's with that stupid getup!?": "",
  "I'm Tashiro, from the Matsugane Family. And this \"getup\" is how a fashionable yakuza dresses in Kamurocho.": "",
  "A-A yakuza? With that look?": "",
  "You're just a gangbanger piece of shit to me. I'll show what it means to be a yakuza!": "",
  "He... fainted. I was going to ask him where the hideout was, but... Eh. Guess I'll have to find it myself.": "",
  "A manhole? Is it possible that it's down there?": "",
  "Nothing to do but check it out.": "",
  "Want me to tag along?": "",
  "Nah, keep watch. Besides... An outfit like that'll stick out like a sore thumb.": "",
  "Fine, have it your way. I didn't wanna mess my threads up anyway. But just shout if shit hits the fan.": "",
  "This is a pretty good spot if you wanted to conduct shady business.": "",
  "(There could be anything up ahead...)": "",
  "(I better let the others know about this, just in case things go south.)": "",
  "(There's that homeless guy from earlier. I think it's safe to say I'm on the right track.)": "",
  "(I bet the other homeless guys were freaked out because they know what the Keihin Gang is up to down here.)": "",
  "Looks like we've got a rat.": "",
  "Honda...": "",
  "Seeking refuge from all the money-hungry cats, are you?": "",
  "Screw refuge. I'm here to pay you back for letting all the cats loose.": "",
  "Interesting. So the rat thinks he can bite back.": "",
  "Your gun smuggling operation is up ahead, right? You use the sewers to get them through the city?": "",
  "Who can say? You're gonna have to fight me if you want to get any further. I'll even let you through if you win.": "",
  "Heh, in that case, I accept the challenge.": "",
  "Hahaha! Good! Let's have a fun brawl!": "",
  "I've heard your whole dastardly plan, evil-doer!": "",
  "Ryan? When did you get here?": "",
  "Where are you looking? I'm over here.": "",
  "Hoho... Behold, my secret ninja technique! Illusory deception art!": "",
  "...Who's he?": "",
  "Oh, he's a homeless guy I met on my part time job.": "",
  "...I'll stop asking questions.": "",
  "Your scheme ends here, villain! Prepare yourself!": "",
  "You said you'd be letting me through, I believe.": "",
  "Do whatever you want, but...": "",
  "I'm not one for stepping into another man's quarrel.": "",
  "Yagami-san. You must enjoy getting in our way.": "",
  "Koga...": "",
  "He's yours to deal with, Koga. I'm taking the loss today.": "",
  "You're the only one left standing. Maybe surrender would be the best option?": "",
  "Sorry, but business is booming right now. No way I'm backing down without a fight.": "",
  "I admit, it wasn't easy tracing you. But guns aren't exactly a competitive market.": "",
  "Yes, and they sell well if you price them for general consumption.": "",
  "People have lost faith in public services in Kamurocho... They'd rather take security into their own hands.": "",
  "And you don't think that you Keihin Gang bastards are at least partially to blame?": "",
  "Of course we are. In other words, we're finally seeing a return on investment.": "",
  "Returns? You're just escalating the situation and trying to take credit for solving it.": "",
  "Well, if it works, it works. After all, I can even offer ten million now for your capture.": "",
  "Right. In that case, I'll just have to sever the funds at the source.": "",
  "The only thing about to be severed here is your head from your neck.": "",
  "You'll regret ever disgracing the Keihin Gang name!": "",
  "Hold up!": "",
  "You guys...": "",
  "You all...": "",
  "I'm just gonna say, my little bro's tough, but I'm waaay tougher.": "",
  "Don't underestimate the power of the lazy and unemployed!": "",
  "And no quips about wearing sunglasses in the dark, please. Old and tired.": "",
  "If this is what I've gotta do to wear it loud and proud...": "",
  "Then Tashiro-kun of the Matsugane Family is gonna represent!": "",
  "I'll show you what it means to dress for the part, you Keihin Gang shitheads!": "",
  "They call me Mr. Try and Hit Me, but who says I can't try to hit people too?": "",
  "Actually... those are my rules. So see if you can hit me, ya bastard!": "",
  "Hoho... I was getting bored waiting for my turn.": "",
  "But surely you are aware of how deadly and precise a ninja's awakening strike can be!?": "",
  "Wh-Who the hell are all these morons?": "",
  "They're with me. They're my friends. And they're here to put you in your place.": "",
  "Did you say they're your... friends? These lunatics?": "",
  "So be it. You can all go to the afterlife as one big happy family!": "",
  "I've already given this location to the cops. Your whole operation is going down, one way or another.": "",
  "Yagami-san, now that everybody knows they can't pay, you're off the hook for that ten million yen prize!": "",
  "The guns were the only way they could afford it, and those are all confiscated.": "",
  "But I heard the big four eluded the cops.": "",
  "I wouldn't expect them to just leave you alone...": "",
  "When they pop back up, I'll just have to deal with them as I have every time, then.": "",
  "Glad we got to put the beatdown on those Keihin assholes together, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I guess we'll call that whole thing with robbing me of my clothes water under the bridge.": "",
  "Heh, just don't change your mind and sue me later, okay?": "",
  "Damn, you sure know how to make a nuisance of yourself, little bro.": "",
  "Next time I'm gonna have to give ya a proper scolding.": "",
  "Heh, maybe I'll come around yet.": "",
  "I feel like this was great training for me. I bet I could dodge bullets now!": "",
  "Pistols, shotguns, maybe even a machine gun! Bring it all on!": "",
  "I'll be all like, whoooooosh!": "",
  "Haha, maybe you should move to America and change your name to \"Mr. Try and Shoot Me.\"": "",
  "I think my ninjutsu has reached at least expert level thanks to you, Master Yagami. ": "",
  "I think I should start considering training my successors in a dojo here in Kamurocho!": "",
  "We'll have to celebrate when it's open. Just let me know.": "",
  "You guys... I just want you to know how much I appreciate it. I had no where else to turn, and you were there for me.": "",
  "Cheesy as it sounds... My friends really were my power.": "",
  "(I really should take the time to visit everyone who helped me and thank them in person.)": "",
  "(My client said he'd be on the roof of Stardust. Odd.)": "",
  "You remember who you're talking to? I'm Mr. Try and Hit Me!": "",
  "I'm not gonna get out. More like... get outta the way.": "",
  "Phew. I think I'm in the clear for now, but I think I better lay low in the office for a while...": "",
  "(If I go out there looking like this, I'm screwed.)": "",
  "(I've gotta figure out how to get by them...)": "",
  "(Who'd know the most about the Keihin Gang? Probably Kim-san.)": "",
  "(I've gotta get to Kim-san's restaurant for now.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, don't be a hero. Your friends would hope that you'd rely on them in times like this.": "",
  "You could at least talk to them about it?": "",
  "(I should hit up anyone in the city who might be willing to help. Hopefully I can figure this out faster that way.)": "",
  "(Maybe I'll check in on one of the city's hangout spots.)": "",
  "(I'll ask whoever's around. Beggars can't be choosers.)": "",
  "(Crap! They have someone on guard.)": "",
  "(I've gotta keep my face concealed for now.)": "",
  "(Nothing I can do about it. Let's hit up another location.)": "",
  "It's me. Yagami.": "",
  "Eh? Why on earth are you dressed like that?": "",
  "Are you okay, by the way? The Keihin Gang seems to want your head on a pike.": "",
  "Well, to tell you the truth...": "",
  "What!? You're trying to take out the Keihin Gang's operations!?": "",
  "You know how crazy that sounds!?": "",
  "And I could use some help. You know anything about their gun smuggling ring?": "",
  "Well, I don't know if this'll be much help, but I overheard one of them...": "",
  "Said something about young guys being interested in guns.": "",
  "Young guys?": "",
  "Yeah. Maybe if you know any spots where punks like that hang out, you'll hear something.": "",
  "Come to think of it...": "",
  "I saw some trouble with a gun in Theater Square earlier... Maybe that'd be a good place to start.": "",
  "I'll give Theater Square a shot.": "",
  "Huh? Who are you?": "",
  "Really? Yagami-san!?": "",
  "Hey, it's not a good time...": "",
  "I'm really sorry, but I can't help you right now.": "",
  "It could get ugly if you stick around here too... So go!": "",
  "(Why'd he kick me out?)": "",
  "Yo, Kamaguchi-san.": "",
  "Is that you, Yagami-san? What the heck?": "",
  "It's the Keihin Gang. They've got a price on my head.": "",
  "Yeah, I knew it was trouble when I saw them handing out flyers.": "",
  "I'm trying to figure out how they're smuggling guns in. You know anything?": "",
  "Sorry, I don't. I cut my ties with those fools.": "",
  "Ah, damn.": "",
  "You're in pretty hot water this time, aren't you?": "",
  "I wish I could help you more, but here, take this with you.": "",
  "Oh, thanks!": "",
  "Wait... Yagami-san?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "*sniff* *sniff*": "*สูด* *สูด*",
  "Hold up!": "เดี๋ยวก่อน!",
  "You guys...": "พวกเธอนี่...",
  "You all...": "พวกคุณทุกคน...",
  "Well, to tell you the truth...": "เอาล่ะ พูดตามตรงนะ...",
  "Oh, thanks!": "โอ้ ขอบใจนะ!"
 }
}
